      "blurb": "Medical Release: Supreme Poison Deity",
      "summonRole": "Supreme Poison Deity",
      "biography": "<p><em>Medical Release: Supreme Poison Deity (S-Rank, concentration up to 1 minute).</em> A huge construct scorpion of poison, toxins and venom. It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC, and rolls its own initiative using your Ninjutsu ability modifier + proficiency bonus.</p><p><strong>Huge Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 22, DR 8 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 90 · <strong>Speed</strong> 60 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +8 (save +8), DEX +2 (save +1), CON +5 (save +5), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Poison, Psychic, Cold, Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing. <strong>Damage Resistances</strong> Lightning, Wind. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Earth, Fire. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> Charmed, Chilled, Bleeding, Shocked, Exhaustion, Stunned, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC, and its initiative bonus.</p>"
